#: ../../source/notebooks/14. 713a4fa27a534cbd9e140c6d67902a87 Modeling
#: Slippage.ipynb:9
msgid "Modeling Slippage"
msgstr "建模滑点"

#: ../../source/notebooks/14. 69101739ed2e4e8d872804d380221c1d Modeling
#: Slippage.ipynb:11
msgid ""
"In live trading, orders rarely fill at the exact price a backtest "
"assumes. Factors like spreads, latency, and the market impact of your own"
" order push fill prices in an adverse direction. This difference is "
"called *slippage*. A backtest that ignores it will overstate a strategy's"
" true performance."
msgstr ""
"在实盘交易中，订单很少能以回测所假设的确切价格成交。买卖价差、延迟以及你自己订单造成的市场冲击等因素，"
"都会使成交价格朝不利方向偏移。这种差异被称为*滑点*。如果回测忽略了滑点，就会高估策略的真实表现。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/14. Modeling Slippage.ipynb:13
#: e8cb604c0d8e473098e3bbcfc8764a85
msgid ""
"This notebook demonstrates **PyBroker's** three built-in slippage models "
"added in v2. It also introduces the `SlippageModel "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.slippage.html#pybroker.slippage.SlippageModel>`__"
" base class, which you can use to write your own custom models."
msgstr ""
"本文档演示了 **PyBroker** 在 v2 中新增的三种内置滑点模型，并介绍了 `SlippageModel "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.slippage.html#pybroker.slippage.SlippageModel>`__"
" 基类，你可以使用它来编写自己的自定义模型。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/14. Modeling Slippage.ipynb:25
#: b51962d4ea2a45db95556df23118ff38
msgid "A Baseline Strategy"
msgstr "基准策略"

#: ../../source/notebooks/14. 6010fcff6098459b880cf1568f22eb63 Modeling
#: Slippage.ipynb:27
#, python-format
msgid ""
"To see the effect of each model, we reuse the dip-buying strategy from "
"`Backtesting a Strategy "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/notebooks/2.%20Backtesting%20a%20Strategy.html>`__."
" The rule is simple: buy when the latest close drops below the previous "
"day's low. We allocate 25% of the portfolio to the position with "
"`calc_target_shares "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.calc_target_shares>`__"
" and hold it for 3 bars via `hold_bars "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.hold_bars>`__."
" Because this strategy trades frequently, small per-fill costs compound "
"into a visible difference in total return."
msgstr ""
"为了观察每种模型的效果，我们复用 `回测策略 "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/notebooks/2.%20Backtesting%20a%20Strategy.html>`__"
" 中的逢低买入策略。规则很简单：当最新收盘价跌破前一天的最低价时买入。我们使用 `calc_target_shares "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.calc_target_shares>`__"
" 将投资组合的 25% 分配给该仓位，并通过 `hold_bars "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.hold_bars>`__"
" 持有 3 根 K 线。由于该策略交易频繁，每次成交的微小成本会累积成总回报中一个明显的差异。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/14. 9226a974c7f54112a4604ba5cb77179e Modeling
#: Slippage.ipynb:71
msgid ""
"First, we run a baseline backtest with no slippage. Every order fills at "
"the unadjusted fill price. By default, this is the midpoint between the "
"bar's low and high prices (`PriceType.MIDDLE "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.common.html#pybroker.common.PriceType.MIDDLE>`__):"
msgstr ""
"首先，我们运行一次没有滑点的基准回测。每笔订单都以未经调整的成交价格成交，默认情况下，该价格是该 K 线最低价与最高价的中点"
"（`PriceType.MIDDLE "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.common.html#pybroker.common.PriceType.MIDDLE>`__）："

#: ../../source/notebooks/14. Modeling Slippage.ipynb:438
#: b457babb830e4f108dc7beb551a9d170
msgid "Fixed Slippage"
msgstr "固定滑点"

#: ../../source/notebooks/14. Modeling Slippage.ipynb:440
#: bb4e71a9394b4ef19f0a497b41f323f5
msgid ""
"The `FixedSlippageModel "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.slippage.html#pybroker.slippage.FixedSlippageModel>`__"
" applies a deterministic, adverse adjustment measured in basis points "
"(where 1 basis point equals 0.01%). Buy fills are increased by ``bps``, "
"while sell fills are decreased. Passing ``bps=0`` disables the adjustment"
" entirely."
msgstr ""
"`FixedSlippageModel "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.slippage.html#pybroker.slippage.FixedSlippageModel>`__"
" 会施加一个确定性的、不利的调整，以基点为单位（1 个基点等于 0.01%）。买入成交价会上调 ``bps``，"
"卖出成交价则会下调 ``bps``。传入 ``bps=0`` 会完全禁用该调整。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/14. Modeling Slippage.ipynb:442
#: c54626e845994594977ef3da03bb6177
msgid ""
"Because the remaining examples run several more backtests, we will also "
"disable logging with `disable_logging "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.scope.html#pybroker.scope.disable_logging>`__"
" to keep the output short. Attach the model to a `Strategy "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy>`__"
" with `set_slippage_model "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.set_slippage_model>`__:"
msgstr ""
"由于接下来的示例还会运行多次回测，我们也会使用 `disable_logging "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.scope.html#pybroker.scope.disable_logging>`__"
" 禁用日志记录，以保持输出简洁。使用 `set_slippage_model "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.set_slippage_model>`__"
" 将模型附加到 `Strategy "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy>`__："

#: ../../source/notebooks/14. 5daadd2f8c924ef483330f2cde7e99e9 Modeling
#: Slippage.ipynb:695
msgid "Volatility Slippage"
msgstr "波动率滑点"

#: ../../source/notebooks/14. Modeling Slippage.ipynb:697
#: e429b9c69adf44db9dd962fd1c5e334c
msgid ""
"Because slippage tends to grow as volatility rises, the "
"`VolatilitySlippageModel "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.slippage.html#pybroker.slippage.VolatilitySlippageModel>`__"
" ties its adverse adjustment to the market's movement. It scales the "
"slippage using the `Average True Range (ATR) "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Average_true_range>`__ of the fill bar "
"(see `atr "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.vect.html#pybroker.vect.atr>`__),"
" pushing the fill price against your order by ``scale * ATR``. The ATR is"
" computed over the ``atr_period`` bars ending at the fill bar; fills "
"during the warmup period, before a full ATR window exists, are left "
"unadjusted:"
msgstr ""
"由于滑点往往会随着波动率上升而增大，`VolatilitySlippageModel "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.slippage.html#pybroker.slippage.VolatilitySlippageModel>`__"
" 将其不利调整与市场波动联系起来。它使用成交 K 线的 `平均真实波幅（ATR） "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Average_true_range>`__"
" （参见 `atr "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.vect.html#pybroker.vect.atr>`__）"
" 来缩放滑点，按 ``scale * ATR`` 将成交价格推向不利于你订单的方向。ATR 是基于截至成交 K 线为止的 ``atr_period``"
" 根 K 线计算的；在预热期内（即尚未形成完整 ATR 窗口之前）的成交将不会被调整："

#: ../../source/notebooks/14. 468b989b3b4d41209f99eb1c17e3fd8c Modeling
#: Slippage.ipynb:948
msgid "Volume Slippage"
msgstr "成交量滑点"

#: ../../source/notebooks/14. Modeling Slippage.ipynb:950
#: a804ccd44947403b85f6399aaa765ed1
msgid ""
"The `VolumeSlippageModel "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.slippage.html#pybroker.slippage.VolumeSlippageModel>`__"
" accounts for finite liquidity by introducing two effects:"
msgstr ""
"`VolumeSlippageModel "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.slippage.html#pybroker.slippage.VolumeSlippageModel>`__"
" 通过引入以下两种效应来考虑有限的流动性："

#: ../../source/notebooks/14. Modeling Slippage.ipynb:952
#: e0c99f3528a04a349f6619d69df87eb3
msgid ""
"**Volume limit:** The number of filled shares is capped at a percentage "
"of the bar's total volume (``volume_limit * volume``). Any remaining "
"shares in the order are dropped rather than filled later."
msgstr ""
"**成交量限制：** 成交股数会被限制在该 K 线总成交量的一定比例以内（``volume_limit * volume``）。"
"订单中剩余的股数会被直接丢弃，而不会延后成交。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/14. Modeling Slippage.ipynb:953
#: dc92a81248694ede96387b067024b049
msgid ""
"**Price impact:** The fill price moves against you based on your order "
"size relative to the market. The adjustment is calculated as "
"``price_impact * (filled_shares / volume) ** 2`` multiplied by the fill "
"price."
msgstr ""
"**价格冲击：** 成交价格会根据你的订单规模相对于市场的大小向不利方向变动。该调整量的计算方式为 "
"``price_impact * (filled_shares / volume) ** 2`` 乘以成交价格。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/14. Modeling Slippage.ipynb:955
#: f90f531a97894d20879108c4b85b0f2b
msgid ""
"A $100,000 account will rarely hit these limits when trading liquid large"
" caps. For example, a 25% allocation would just be a rounding error in "
"Ford's daily volume. However, that same allocation can be a significant "
"portion of the day's trading in thinly traded small caps. Without a "
"volume model, the backtest unrealistically assumes the entire order fills"
" at the quoted price:"
msgstr ""
"一个 10 万美元的账户在交易流动性充足的大盘股时，很少会触及这些限制。例如，25% 的配置比例在福特汽车的日成交量中"
"甚至算不上一个舍入误差。然而，同样的配置比例在交易清淡的小盘股中，却可能占当日成交量的相当大一部分。如果没有"
"成交量模型，回测就会不切实际地假设整笔订单都能以报价成交："

#: ../../source/notebooks/14. 62d2a9edd93b4989bc2c9389d6fef372 Modeling
#: Slippage.ipynb:1215
msgid "Writing a Custom Slippage Model"
msgstr "编写自定义滑点模型"

#: ../../source/notebooks/14. Modeling Slippage.ipynb:1217
#: df5a4b7307964d89aab9d56082622ea7
msgid ""
"To create your own model, subclass `SlippageModel "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.slippage.html#pybroker.slippage.SlippageModel>`__"
" and override the `apply_slippage "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.slippage.html#pybroker.slippage.SlippageModel.apply_slippage>`__"
" method. This method takes a `SlippageContext "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.slippage.html#pybroker.slippage.SlippageContext>`__"
" object containing the order's `side "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.slippage.html#pybroker.slippage.SlippageContext.side>`__"
" (``\"buy\"`` or ``\"sell\"``), `symbol "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.slippage.html#pybroker.slippage.SlippageContext.symbol>`__,"
" `shares "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.slippage.html#pybroker.slippage.SlippageContext.shares>`__,"
" and the initial `fill_price "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.slippage.html#pybroker.slippage.SlippageContext.fill_price>`__."
" Your method must then return a tuple with the adjusted ``(shares, "
"fill_price)``."
msgstr ""
"要创建你自己的模型，请继承 `SlippageModel "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.slippage.html#pybroker.slippage.SlippageModel>`__"
" 并重写 `apply_slippage "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.slippage.html#pybroker.slippage.SlippageModel.apply_slippage>`__"
" 方法。该方法接受一个 `SlippageContext "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.slippage.html#pybroker.slippage.SlippageContext>`__"
" 对象，其中包含订单的 `side "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.slippage.html#pybroker.slippage.SlippageContext.side>`__"
" （``\"buy\"`` 或 ``\"sell\"``）、`symbol "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.slippage.html#pybroker.slippage.SlippageContext.symbol>`__、"
"`shares "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.slippage.html#pybroker.slippage.SlippageContext.shares>`__"
" 以及初始的 `fill_price "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.slippage.html#pybroker.slippage.SlippageContext.fill_price>`__"
"。你的方法随后必须返回一个包含调整后 ``(shares, fill_price)`` 的元组。"

